{"id": "f894521f-9723-4c2a-afc0-82a1c6a17c1c", "slug": "archive-reader-1", "title": "Archive Reader", "description": "Archive Reader Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Archive Reader\"\ndescription: \"Archive Reader Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#A33B3B\"\n  secondary: \"#555047\"\n  accent: \"#C2A47A\"\n  background: \"#0C0C0B\"\n  surface: \"#555047\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#555047\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Cinzel\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Crimson Pro\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"2px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Archive Reader\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 19; favorites: 5; remixes: 2.\nTags: sidebar, bento, cta, animated, webgl, threejs, navigation, flow.\n## Overview\nArchive Reader Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nSystem Catalog Cyber-Mythos The Initialization Boot Sequence Alpha Loading the Construct Syntax Errors The Logic Bomb Memory Leak Detection Night Cycle Render The Override Mainframe Breach ← Return to Terminal S ys. We…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Cyber-Mythos; The Architecture of Sector-H; Annotation:.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #A33B3B, secondary #555047, accent #C2A47A, background #0C0C0B, surface #555047, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Cinzel for display moments and Crimson Pro for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Archive Reader</title>\n\n    <!-- Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@500;600&amp;family=Crimson+Pro:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&amp;family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <!-- Scripts -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <style>\n        /* Custom Font Assignments */\n        .font-gothic { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; }\n        .font-serif-text { font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif; }\n        .font-mono-ui { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }\n\n        /* Hide scrollbar but keep functionality */\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }\n        * { -ms-overflow-style: none; scrollbar-width: none; }\n\n        /* Image Gradient Border Wrapper */\n        .gradient-border-wrap {\n            position: relative;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,100,100,0.5) 0%, rgba(100,100,255,0.2) 100%);\n            padding: 2px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n        }\n\n        /* Drop Cap Styling */\n        .drop-cap {\n            float: left;\n            font-size: 5rem;\n            line-height: 0.8;\n            padding-right: 0.5rem;\n            padding-top: 0.2rem;\n            color: #a33b3b;\n        }\n\n        /* Masked Text Reveal Setup */\n        .word-mask {\n            display: inline-block;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            vertical-align: top;\n        }\n        .word-inner {\n            display: inline-block;\n            transform: translateY(110%);\n        }\n\n        /* Smooth rendering for scaled book */\n        .book-container {\n            transform-style: preserve-3d;\n            perspective: 1000px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#0c0c0b] text-neutral-300 font-serif-text h-screen w-full flex overflow-hidden selection:bg-neutral-800 selection:text-white\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background Container -->\n    <div id=\"canvas-container\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-40\"></div>\n\n    <!-- UI Container Lines (Skill Directive) -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none flex justify-between px-8\">\n        <div class=\"w-px h-full bg-white/[0.03] relative\">\n            <div class=\"absolute -top-[1.5px] -left-[1.5px] w-[4px] h-[4px] bg-white/20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[1.5px] -left-[1.5px] w-[4px] h-[4px] bg-white/20\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"w-px h-full bg-white/[0.03] relative hidden md:block\">\n            <div class=\"absolute -top-[1.5px] -left-[1.5px] w-[4px] h-[4px] bg-white/20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[1.5px] -left-[1.5px] w-[4px] h-[4px] bg-white/20\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Layout Wrapper -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex h-full w-full\">\n\n        <!-- Left Sidebar -->\n        <aside class=\"w-64 flex-shrink-0 border-r border-white/[0.05] bg-[#0c0c0b]/80 backdrop-blur-sm hidden md:flex flex-col py-10 px-8 justify-between z-20\">\n            <div>\n                <!-- Titles -->\n                <div class=\"mb-12\">\n                    <p class=\"font-mono-ui text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.2em] text-[#6b655b] uppercase mb-1\">System Catalog</p>\n                    <h1 class=\"font-gothic text-2xl text-[#b58b54] tracking-tight\">Cyber-Mythos</h1>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Navigation -->\n                <nav class=\"space-y-8 font-mono-ui text-[0.7rem] tracking-wide\">\n                    <!-- Section 1 -->\n                    <div>\n                        <p class=\"text-[#555047] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] mb-4\">The Initialization</p>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-3 pl-1 text-[#8b8274]\">\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[#c2a47a] transition-colors hover:text-white cursor-pointer\">\n                                <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#c2a47a]\"></span>\n                                Boot Sequence Alpha\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors hover:text-white cursor-pointer\">\n                                <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-transparent border border-[#555047]\"></span>\n                                Loading the Construct\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Section 2 -->\n                    <div>\n                        <p class=\"text-[#555047] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] mb-4\">Syntax Errors</p>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-3 pl-1 text-[#8b8274]\">\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors hover:text-white cursor-pointer\">\n                                <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-transparent border border-[#555047]\"></span>\n                                The Logic Bomb\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors hover:text-white cursor-pointer\">\n                                <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-transparent border border-[#555047]\"></span>\n                                Memory Leak Detection\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors hover:text-white cursor-pointer\">\n                                <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-transparent border border-[#555047]\"></span>\n                                Night Cycle Render\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Section 3 -->\n                    <div>\n                        <p class=\"text-[#555047] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] mb-4\">The Override</p>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-3 pl-1 text-[#8b8274]\">\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors hover:text-white cursor-pointer\">\n                                <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-transparent border border-[#555047]\"></span>\n                                Mainframe Breach\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </nav>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Footer Action -->\n            <button class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[#555047] font-mono-ui text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase hover:text-white transition-colors group\">\n                <span class=\"group-hover:-translate-x-1 transition-transform\">←</span> Return to Terminal\n            </button>\n        </aside>\n\n        <!-- Main Content Area -->\n        <main class=\"flex-1 flex justify-center items-center p-4 md:p-12 overflow-y-auto md:overflow-hidden perspective-container\">\n\n            <!-- The Book Container -->\n            <div class=\"book-container flex flex-col md:flex-row w-full max-w-[1024px] bg-[#d9d1bd] shadow-[0_20px_70px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)] text-[#2a2a2a] relative rounded-[2px] overflow-hidden min-h-[700px]\">\n\n                <!-- Center Crease Shadow -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-1/2 -ml-8 w-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#b5ab95]/80 to-transparent pointer-events-none hidden md:block z-20 mix-blend-multiply\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-1/2 -ml-[1px] w-[2px] bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-[#8a7f69]/40 to-transparent pointer-events-none hidden md:block z-20\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Page Shadows on Edges -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/20 to-transparent pointer-events-none z-20\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 right-0 w-4 bg-gradient-to-l from-black/20 to-transparent pointer-events-none z-20\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Left Page -->\n                <article class=\"w-full md:w-1/2 px-10 py-12 flex flex-col justify-between relative bg-gradient-to-br from-white/20 to-transparent\">\n                    <div>\n                        <div class=\"reveal-text mb-6\">\n                            <span class=\"font-gothic drop-cap text-[#a33b3b]\">S</span>\n                            <span class=\"font-gothic text-sm tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#333]\">ys. We operate in</span>\n                            <p class=\"text-[1.05rem] leading-relaxed mt-2 text-[#222]\">\n                                cycles past, grid-kings, power recognized, how those constructs executed logic flawlessly. Often Alpha-node disrupted rogue subroutines, from many clusters, severed connections, terrified users.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"reveal-text my-8 px-6 border-l-[1.5px] border-[#a33b3b]/30\">\n                            <p class=\"italic text-[#444] text-base leading-relaxed\">\n                                \"So. The Core-Nodes in cycles gone by and the admins who ruled them had bandwidth and processing power. We have parsed logs of those entities' heroic computations.\"\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Image Section with Border Gradient -->\n                        <div class=\"mt-8 flex justify-center w-full\">\n                            <div class=\"gradient-border-wrap w-full max-w-[280px]\">\n                                <div class=\"bg-[#d9d1bd] p-2 relative h-[280px] w-full overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                    <!-- Replaced manuscript art with image -->\n                                    <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580584126903-c17d41830450?ixid=M3w3NTc5NzN8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwyfHxjaXJjdWl0JTIwYm9hcmR8ZW58MXwwfHx8MTc3NDc1MTc4MXww&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;w=800&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Cyberpunk Circuitry\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-90 mix-blend-multiply\">\n                                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[url('https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/stucco.png')] opacity-10 mix-blend-multiply pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"text-center mt-12 mb-2\">\n                        <p class=\"font-mono-ui text-[0.6rem] tracking-[0.25em] text-[#777] uppercase\">Block VII — Sectors I-XII</p>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n\n                <!-- Right Page -->\n                <article class=\"w-full md:w-1/2 px-10 py-12 flex flex-col justify-between relative bg-gradient-to-bl from-white/20 to-transparent\">\n                    <div>\n                        <div class=\"text-center mb-8 reveal-text\">\n                            <h2 class=\"font-gothic text-[1.4rem] tracking-tight text-[#b26938]\">The Architecture of Sector-H</h2>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"space-y-6 reveal-text\">\n                            <p class=\"text-[1.05rem] leading-relaxed text-[#222]\">\n                                Then was Admin-H granted algorithmic efficiency, processing prestige, so that his sub-routines eagerly complied, until the network grew, a massive server farm. It came into his logic circuits, that a central hub he would command to be built...\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"text-[1.05rem] leading-relaxed text-[#222]\">\n                                The structure scaled, its cooling towers wide and high and awaiting a critical thermal event. That crash abided, but in time it would come: the destructive malware unleashed among peer-nodes, the bandwidth-lust rampant.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Marginalia Box -->\n                        <div class=\"mt-10 bg-[#cec6b2]/60 p-6 shadow-inner border border-[#c4bc9f]/40 reveal-text\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-gothic text-lg text-[#a33b3b] mb-3\">Annotation:</h3>\n                            <p class=\"italic text-[#444] text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed\">\n                                \"The system architect suggests the hub was intended as a monument to Admin-H's uptime, yet foretells its inevitable corruption by external payload.\"\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"text-center mt-12 mb-2\">\n                        <p class=\"font-mono-ui text-[0.6rem] tracking-[0.25em] text-[#777] uppercase\">Block VIII — The Mainframe</p>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n\n                <!-- Texture Overlay for whole book -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[url('https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/cream-paper.png')] opacity-40 mix-blend-multiply pointer-events-none z-30\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Logic -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n\n            // --- 1. Masked Word Reveal Logic (GSAP) ---\n            const revealElements = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-text');\n\n            revealElements.forEach(el => {\n                // Keep original HTML for complex structures (like drop caps),\n                // only split simple text nodes within p, span, h2, h3\n                const textNodes = Array.from(el.childNodes).filter(node =>\n                    node.nodeType === Node.TEXT_NODE && node.textContent.trim().length > 0\n                );\n\n                if(textNodes.length > 0 || el.tagName.toLowerCase() === 'p' || el.tagName.toLowerCase() === 'h2') {\n                    // Very simple text splitting wrapper to avoid external dependencies\n                    let html = el.innerHTML;\n                    // Regex to wrap words, ignoring HTML tags\n                    let wrappedHtml = html.replace(/(>|^)([^<]+)(<|$)/g, function(match, start, text, end) {\n                        let words = text.split(/(\\s+)/).map(word => {\n                            if (word.trim().length === 0) return word; // preserve spaces\n                            return `<span class=\"word-mask\"><span class=\"word-inner\">${word}</span></span>`;\n                        }).join('');\n                        return start + words + end;\n                    });\n\n                    el.innerHTML = wrappedHtml;\n                }\n            });\n\n            // Animate wrapped words\n            gsap.to('.word-inner', {\n                y: '0%',\n                duration: 0.8,\n                stagger: 0.015,\n                ease: \"power3.out\",\n                delay: 0.2\n            });\n\n            // Animate book entrance\n            gsap.from('.book-container', {\n                y: 50,\n                opacity: 0,\n                duration: 1.2,\n                ease: \"expo.out\"\n            });\n\n\n            // --- 2. Subtle WebGL Background (Three.js) ---\n            // Creates a subtle retro-futuristic data grid/particle effect\n            const initWebGL = () => {\n                const container = document.getElementById('canvas-container');\n                const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n                const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(75, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n                const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n                renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n                container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n                // Create a subtle wireframe terrain/grid\n                const geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(200, 200, 40, 40);\n                const material = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({\n                    color: 0x68a0b0,\n                    wireframe: true,\n                    transparent: true,\n                    opacity: 0.05\n                });\n\n                const plane = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n                plane.rotation.x = -Math.PI / 2 + 0.2;\n                plane.position.y = -30;\n                scene.add(plane);\n\n                camera.position.z = 50;\n\n                // Animation loop\n                let time = 0;\n                const animate = function () {\n                    requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                    time += 0.001;\n\n                    // Gentle wave motion\n                    const positionAttribute = geometry.attributes.position;\n                    for ( let i = 0; i < positionAttribute.count; i ++ ) {\n                        const x = positionAttribute.getX(i);\n                        const y = positionAttribute.getY(i);\n                        // Subtle distortion\n                        positionAttribute.setZ(i, Math.sin(x * 0.1 + time) * 2 + Math.cos(y * 0.1 + time) * 2);\n                    }\n                    positionAttribute.needsUpdate = true;\n\n                    plane.rotation.z = time * 0.2;\n\n                    renderer.render(scene, camera);\n                };\n\n                animate();\n\n                // Handle resize\n                window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                    camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                    camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                    renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n                });\n            };\n\n            // Initialize WebGL\n            if(typeof THREE !== 'undefined') {\n                initWebGL();\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "archive-reader-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/archive-reader-1.jpg", "source_name": "archive-reader-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 129, "forks": 6, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-01T06:08:51.732961+00:00"}